      "text": "The main symptoms of atrial fibrillation include an irregular, unsteady pulse; a sudden pounding, racing, fluttering, skipping or missed heartbeat lasting a few seconds up to a few minutes; a heartbeat faster than 100 beats per minute; feeling very tired; difficulty exercising; chest pain or tightness; and breathlessness, lightheadedness, dizziness or feeling faint.",
