      "text": "Chagas disease is endemic to all continental Latin American countries; in chronic Chagas cardiomyopathy, the association of atrial fibrillation and apical aneurysms, along with a hypercoagulable state from T. cruzi infection, produces higher rates of embolic events than in heart failure of other causes.",
