      "topic": "Atrial fibrillation",
      "step": "consequences",
      "text": "Symptomatic rheumatic heart disease is a burden in low-income regions where surgical treatment options are limited; atrial fibrillation is a major cause of morbidity and mortality in patients with rheumatic heart disease.",
