      "topic": "Atrial fibrillation",
      "step": "consequences",
      "text": "Atrial fibrillation significantly increases thromboembolic risk, including ischaemic stroke, regardless of its temporal pattern; without appropriate treatment, ischaemic stroke risk is increased five-fold, and one in every five strokes is linked to atrial fibrillation.",
