      "topic": "Atrial fibrillation",
      "step": "mechanism",
      "text": "Accumulating evidence links inflammation to the onset and maintenance of atrial fibrillation; inflammation contributes to structural and electrophysiological atrial remodelling that forms the basis for the disease.",
