      "topic": "Atrial fibrillation",
      "step": "pathophysiology",
      "text": "Several mechanisms involving electrical and structural remodelling of atrial tissue have been proposed to contribute to atrial fibrillation, and fibrosis has been studied thoroughly, confirming its significant role in this process.",
