      "topic": "Atrial flutter",
      "step": "mechanism",
      "text": "In atrial flutter, the cavotricuspid isthmus has a crucial role in impulse propagation as the circuit's slow-conduction zone, making it highly vulnerable to interval-dependent conduction block.",
