      "step": "differential",
      "text": "In older adults, reduced exercise tolerance may reflect normal physiological ageing or noncardiac causes, and comorbidities can mimic heart-failure signs and complicate diagnosis; older people with preserved-ejection-fraction heart failure may lack classic symptoms and have subtle presentations.",
