      "text": "Even symptomatic heart failure can be difficult to diagnose and treat early because of poor public awareness and suboptimal nonspecialist diagnosis with potentially limited access to tests such as echocardiography; its variable presentation includes breathlessness and exercise intolerance overlapping with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, chronic kidney disease, anaemia and diabetes.",
