      "topic": "Heart failure",
      "step": "management",
      "text": "Surgery for heart failure may be needed to improve blood flow through blocked or damaged arteries, repair or replace damaged valves, or fit a pacemaker or implantable cardioverter defibrillator to control heart rate or correct an irregular heartbeat.",
