      "topic": "Heart failure",
      "step": "management",
      "text": "As part of heart failure treatment, referral should be made to a doctor-and-nurse palliative or symptom-control team; palliative care focuses on quality of life for anyone with a lifelong incurable illness and includes symptom management, comfort, practical needs such as home equipment, family support and end-of-life care if appropriate.",
