      "step": "management",
      "text": "Everyone diagnosed with heart failure should be offered cardiac rehabilitation; depending on their condition and local availability, it may include safe-exercise assessment and advice, classes or an individual exercise programme, lifestyle information and support such as healthy eating, and support groups sharing experiences; programmes may run in hospital, clinics or the community with in-person or online sessions.",
