      "topic": "Infective endocarditis",
      "step": "management",
      "text": "If you have symptoms of endocarditis, a doctor will examine you, listen to your chest and ask about recent dental treatment or other medical procedures. If they suspect endocarditis, you will usually be referred to a heart specialist (cardiologist).",
      "population": "",
      "numbers": "",
      "source": "NHS website: Endocarditis",
      "source_url": "https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/endocarditis/",
      "checked_on": "2026-11-25",
