      "topic": "Mitral regurgitation",
      "step": "clinical features",
      "text": "In advanced mitral regurgitation, or after it worsens acutely, for example after sudden chordal rupture, symptoms occur alongside left ventricular systolic dysfunction and/or pulmonary hypertension.",
