      "topic": "Mitral regurgitation",
      "step": "clinical features",
      "text": "Initial assessment of mitral regurgitation includes a full medical and medication history, complete physical examination with cardiac auscultation and an ECG. Recognising valve-related symptoms such as breathlessness takes experience, especially in older people who are likely to limit daily activities without reporting complaints at assessment.",
      "population": "",
      "numbers": "",
