      "topic": "Sarcoidosis",
      "step": "risk factors",
      "text": "Possible causes of sarcoidosis include exposure to substances in the environment (such as mould, wood stoves, soil, tree pollen, insecticides, silica and other substances), viral or bacterial infections, and autoimmunity (the body's immune system attacking its own tissues and organs).",
