      "topic": "Systemic lupus erythematosus",
      "step": "clinical features",
      "text": "Lupus often flares up (relapses), with symptoms becoming worse for a few weeks, sometimes longer, and then settling down (remission); the reason why symptoms flare up or settle down is not known.",
