      "topic": "Systemic lupus erythematosus",
      "step": "clinical features",
      "text": "The main symptoms of lupus include joint and muscle pain; extreme tiredness that will not go away however much the person rests; and rashes that usually come on after being in the sun, often over the nose and cheeks.",
