      "step": "consequences",
      "text": "Lupus can be mild, moderate or severe: mild lupus causes joint and skin problems and tiredness; moderate lupus causes inflammation of other parts of the skin and body, including the lungs, heart and kidneys; severe lupus causes inflammation with severe damage to the heart, lungs, brain or kidneys, which can be life-threatening.",
